    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pb_pp1_t",
      "x": 1912,
      "y": 2947,
      "width": 356,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "格式与转码规则\n────────────\n· MP3 / WAV / M4A → 浏览器直传\n· FLAC → Chrome/Firefox 直传；Safari 走转码\n· 其他不支持的格式 → 一律转码\n· 转码：ffmpeg 子进程，FLAC → MP3\n· 缓存：cache/transcode/<song_id>-<audio_hash>.mp3\n· 失效：audio_hash 变化 / 超 30 天未访问",
      "originalText": "格式与转码规则\n────────────\n· MP3 / WAV / M4A → 浏览器直传\n· FLAC → Chrome/Firefox 直传；Safari 走转码\n· 其他不支持的格式 → 一律转码\n· 转码：ffmpeg 子进程，FLAC → MP3\n· 缓存：cache/transcode/<song_id>-<audio_hash>.mp3\n· 失效：audio_hash 变化 / 超 30 天未访问",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1100101,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1100102,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": "pb_pp1",
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "pb_pp2",
      "x": 2320,
      "y": 2937,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#0284c7",
      "backgroundColor": "#f0f9ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1100103,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1100104,
