    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pb_pp2_t",
      "x": 2332,
      "y": 2947,
      "width": 356,
      "height": 170,
      "text": "Range / 流式规则\n────────────\n· 请求头 Range: bytes=start-end\n· 响应 206 + Content-Range + Accept-Ranges\n· 无 Range → 200 全量\n· 越界 → 416 Range Not Satisfiable\n· 直传走 read_range()，不把整文件读进内存\n· MIME：audio/mpeg · audio/flac · audio/wav",
      "originalText": "Range / 流式规则\n────────────\n· 请求头 Range: bytes=start-end\n· 响应 206 + Content-Range + Accept-Ranges\n· 无 Range → 200 全量\n· 越界 → 416 Range Not Satisfiable\n· 直传走 read_range()，不把整文件读进内存\n· MIME：audio/mpeg · audio/flac · audio/wav",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "strokeColor": "#075985",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 1100105,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1100106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": "pb_pp2",
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "pb_pp3",
      "x": 2740,
      "y": 2937,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 190,
      "strokeColor": "#047857",
      "backgroundColor": "#ecfdf5",
