      "type": "text",
      "id": "rq_p2_t",
      "x": 3842,
      "y": 1320,
      "width": 1476,
      "height": 96,
      "text": "去重与合并\n────────────\n· dedup_key = normalize(title) + normalize(artist)\n· 命中已有 → 不新建，写 request_votes +1（幂等）\n· 合并后按需求人数排序（多人想要优先）\n· 表：song_requests + request_votes",
      "originalText": "去重与合并\n────────────\n· dedup_key = normalize(title) + normalize(artist)\n· 命中已有 → 不新建，写 request_votes +1（幂等）\n· 合并后按需求人数排序（多人想要优先）\n· 表：song_requests + request_votes",
