      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "sec_order",
      "x": 3720,
      "y": 3944,
      "width": 1700,
      "height": 400,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 2500019,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2500020,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "sec_order_t",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "sec_order_t",
      "x": 3734,
      "y": 3958,
      "width": 1672,
      "height": 376,
      "text": "1   setsid()                     新会话 + 新进程组（便于整组 kill）\n2   rlimit AS     512 MB         内存上限\n3   rlimit CPU    60 s           CPU 时间上限\n4   rlimit NPROC  64             防 fork 炸弹\n5   rlimit FSIZE  100 MB         单文件大小上限\n6   rlimit NOFILE 256            文件描述符上限\n7   rlimit CORE   0              不产生 core dump\n8   prctl NO_NEW_PRIVS = 1       禁止提权（setuid 二进制全部失效）\n9   prctl PDEATHSIG = SIGKILL    父进程死了自己跟着死\n10  setgroups(0, NULL)           清空附加组\n11  setgid(plugin_gid)           降组\n12  setuid(plugin_uid)           降用户\n\n顺序要点：11 → 12 不能反；rlimit 必须在降权前设（降权后就抬不高了）",
      "originalText": "1   setsid()                     新会话 + 新进程组（便于整组 kill）\n2   rlimit AS     512 MB         内存上限\n3   rlimit CPU    60 s           CPU 时间上限\n4   rlimit NPROC  64             防 fork 炸弹\n5   rlimit FSIZE  100 MB         单文件大小上限\n6   rlimit NOFILE 256            文件描述符上限\n7   rlimit CORE   0              不产生 core dump\n8   prctl NO_NEW_PRIVS = 1       禁止提权（setuid 二进制全部失效）\n9   prctl PDEATHSIG = SIGKILL    父进程死了自己跟着死\n10  setgroups(0, NULL)           清空附加组\n11  setgid(plugin_gid)           降组\n12  setuid(plugin_uid)           降用户\n\n顺序要点：11 → 12 不能反；rlimit 必须在降权前设（降权后就抬不高了）",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
