    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "pl_batch_t",
      "x": 3736,
      "y": 2228,
      "width": 3448,
      "height": 106,
      "text": "并发槽 N = 3（歌曲级并发）\n    槽 1: 歌A → netease ✗ → qqmusic ✓            插件进程池：netease max=1 ｜ qqmusic max=1 ｜ musicbrainz max=2\n    槽 2: 歌B → netease ✓                         队列 = songs 表 scrape_status = pending（不另建任务表）\n    槽 3: 歌C → netease ✗ → musicbrainz ✓         进程按需 spawn · 用完回 idle · 空闲 5 分钟回收",
      "originalText": "并发槽 N = 3（歌曲级并发）\n    槽 1: 歌A → netease ✗ → qqmusic ✓            插件进程池：netease max=1 ｜ qqmusic max=1 ｜ musicbrainz max=2\n    槽 2: 歌B → netease ✓                         队列 = songs 表 scrape_status = pending（不另建任务表）\n    槽 3: 歌C → netease ✗ → musicbrainz ✓         进程按需 spawn · 用完回 idle · 空闲 5 分钟回收",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
